From 02ff1e5840ee0fe170e19f47e49f7191925caf09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 08:25:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] apps: commit system Home and Overview gestures without motion

Overview-ready haptics (haptic half of the former 0011-overview-ready-haptics-and-static-task-menus): with static gestures the Overview-ready point vibrates with the task-scroll primitive (EinkOverviewUi.vibrateOverviewReady, added to the class from 0006) also without a running animation, once per gesture. Requires 0006.

Change-Id: I6e857e22e1bfe9864f53b05015e194a93f0deb62
